{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/5n8upz","slideIndex":0,"text":"All rupee figures are user-supplied planning estimates, not provider quotations or measured spending. Setup calculation: training 2000 + first-year domain 800 + optional one NFC unit 1500 + demo setup 0 = INR 2800 to 4300. Domain is recurring annually. Monthly indicative maximum = Gemini 500 + Sarvam 300 + hosting 500 = INR 1300. INR 0.35 per record is an unvalidated API cost target, excludes fixed costs, and lacks a specified token/audio/record-volume assumption. Do not infer a guaranteed production facility cost. Existing computer/Android phone, staff time, internet, storage, backups, security, support, taxes and durable production hosting are excluded. Render free services are for demos/testing and not recommended for production: https://render.com/docs/free . Free web services spin down after inactivity and local filesystem data is ephemeral, so production SQLite requires durable storage or hospital-hosted infrastructure. Gemini official pricing: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing . Sarvam pricing: https://docs.sarvam.ai/api/getting-started/pricing . Scaling phases and NHM partnership are proposed, not confirmed partnerships or approved subsidies. Funding-free sustainability and guaranteed reduction in doctor interventions are not established."}